@prefix pc: <https://example.invalid/nebula/ont/commercial-example/> .
@prefix d: <https://example.invalid/nebula/data/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://example.invalid/nebula/modules/pc-property> a owl:Ontology ; owl:versionIRI <https://example.invalid/nebula/modules/pc-property/1> .

pc:PropertyCoverage a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf pc:Coverage .
pc:atLocation a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:PropertyCoverage ; rdfs:range pc:Location .
